  "rationale": "12 units of Pav 400G at Outlet 01 (North Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-24; doing nothing writes off ₹734 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1555. This play uses a bundle with SKU-TONED-MILK-1L at ₹155 for 432 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Personal care regulars, Sweets occasionals, Festival sweets loyalists, Dairy occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers): expected 31 units, margin ₹470, discount cost ₹616, waste avoided ₹734 (CI 2 to 90 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs Pav 400G with Toned Milk 1L at a bundle price of 155 INR, which satisfies the 8% category margin floor and is preferred over markdowns by policy. It targets all six consenting customer segments to maximize reach and clear the 12 units at risk before expiry.",
